COMMENT ON TABLE public.amazon_market_baskets IS 'Amazon Brand Analytics market baskets by week: the other products bought together with each of our ASINs. Grain: one row per (week_start, marketplace_id, asin, purchased_with_asin). Source: etl.feeds amazon_market_baskets (ExpandFi warehouse, merchant 1452: brand_analytics_market_baskets, period WEEK). Refresh: feeds service 21:00 UTC (python -m etl.feeds run), trailing 6 weeks; each run replaces its window, an empty pull writes nothing. Coverage: weeks from 2026-06-28 (US; one MX week). Caveats: combination_pct is the percent (0-100) of orders containing our ASIN that also contained the other ASIN; only the top few companions are reported.';
