COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_market_baskets.loaded_at IS 'When the row was loaded.';
COMMENT ON VIEW analytics.amazon_repeat_purchases IS 'Amazon Brand Analytics repeat purchase behaviour by week and ASIN: orders, unique customers and the share that are repeat customers. Grain: one row per (week_start, marketplace_id, asin). Source: public.amazon_repeat_purchases (ExpandFi merchant 1452). Refresh: feeds service 21:00 UTC (python -m etl.feeds run), trailing 6 weeks; each run replaces its window, an empty pull writes nothing. Coverage: weeks from 2026-06-28 (US and MX). Caveats: Percentages are 0-100. Amazon computes repeat over its own look-back window, so the figures do not tie to the cohort tables.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_repeat_purchases.week_start IS 'Sunday starting the week.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_repeat_purchases.week_end IS 'Saturday ending the week.';
