COMMENT ON VIEW analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily IS 'Amazon settlement lines summed by posted day and fee or transaction type: what Amazon actually charged and paid (referral and FBA fees, promotions, advertising charges, reimbursements). Grain: one row per (day, marketplace_name, transaction_type, amount_type, amount_description). Source: public.amazon_settlement_fees_daily (ExpandFi merchant 1452). Refresh: feeds service 21:00 UTC (python -m etl.feeds run), trailing 45 days; each run replaces its window, an empty pull writes nothing. Coverage: 2024-03-18 (a few older rows from 2017) to the newest settlement; settlements arrive in batches, so the newest day can be two weeks old. Caveats: Amounts are signed as Amazon stores them: sales are positive, fees, promotions and ad charges negative, refunds negative. | Posted-day basis, so it does not tie to the purchase-day revenue of amazon_orders_asin_daily. ''Cost of Advertising'' here is the settlement debit, not the Ads report spend.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily.day IS 'Posted day of the settlement line.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily.marketplace_name IS 'Marketplace of the line ('''' when blank).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily.transaction_type IS 'Order | Refund | ServiceFee | FBAFees | AmazonFees | other-transaction ...';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily.amount_type IS 'Fee group, e.g. ItemPrice, ItemFees, Promotion, Cost of Advertising.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily.amount_description IS 'Detail, e.g. Principal, Commission, FBAPerUnitFulfillmentFee.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily.lines IS 'Settlement lines summed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily.amount IS 'Sum of amount in the line currency, signed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily.amount_usd IS 'Sum of amount in US dollars, signed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily.currency IS 'Currency code of the lines.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_settlement_fees_daily.loaded_at IS 'When the row was loaded.';
